        "question": "Can a public contract price be used as a benchmark for a private outsourcing deal?",
        "answer": "Only with caution. A public award reflects a specific scope, period, location, and evaluation method that may differ from your requirement. The headline value may also include options or taxes. Record the differences before drawing any comparison."
